{"id":"wb-7-1543","name":"棘梁山石刻","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"棘梁山石刻","text":"棘梁山石刻，也称作司里山石刻造像，位于山东省泰安市东平县戴庙镇司里村东司里山上，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n1992年6月12日，授予山东省文物保护单位，2013年3月5日，列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位，是一座石窟寺及石刻。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A3%98%E6%A2%81%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E5%88%BB","revisionId":86801031,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86801031","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/04132038d05f4374b8f85d03.jpg","title":"20220130_司里山摩崖造像.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20220130_%E5%8F%B8%E9%87%8C%E5%B1%B1%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/14/20220130_%E5%8F%B8%E9%87%8C%E5%B1%B1%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Ngguls","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​司里山摩崖造像。该处系全国重点文物保护单位。","width":320,"height":240}}